    "_P5_title": "SETUP Section 13: Type Methods — Structure",
    "_P5_brief": "Format-agnostic structure definition. What Type Methods IS, not how it manifests in any language. See format/blocks/{lang}/setup/type-methods.jsonc for language-specific content.",

    // ===================================================================
